": 9}, {"w": "working", "s": 84.346, "e": 84.636, "p": 9}, {"w": "on,", "s": 84.718, "e": 85.066, "p": 9}, {"w": "and", "s": 85.124, "e": 85.402, "p": 9}, {"w": "start", "s": 85.519, "e": 85.797, "p": 9}, {"w": "applying", "s": 85.82, "e": 86.227, "p": 9}, {"w": "it", "s": 86.273, "e": 86.343, "p": 9}, {"w": "alongside", "s": 86.389, "e": 87.005, "p": 9}, {"w": "us.", "s": 87.063, "e": 87.562, "p": 9}], "paras": [{"s": 0.6, "e": 7.427, "text": "Every week, I'm working on something in my business that involves AI, SaaS, or GoHighLevel."}, {"s": 7.727, "e": 17.525, "text": "Sometimes I'm building a product. Sometimes I'm working on getting customers. Sometimes I'm figuring out how to automate something that's taking too much time."}, {"s": 17.825, "e": 26.463, "text": "And along the way, I'm finding tools, building skills, testing strategies, and figuring out how these pieces work together."}, {"s": 26.763, "e": 30.85, "text": "This community is where I'm opening that up and sharing it with you."}, {"s": 31.15, "e": 40.856, "text": "You'll get the training behind what I'm doing, the available skills and resources that go with it, and coaching to help you apply it to your own business."}, {"s": 41.156, "e": 52.275, "text": "Because watching somebody build something is helpful. Being able to understand the decisions, get the resources, and ask questions makes it easier to build your version."}, {"s": 52.575, "e": 62.792, "text": "We'll cover using GoHighLevel, building with AI, creating SaaS offers, getting clients, and putting systems in place as you grow."}, {"s": 63.092, "e": 73.355, "text": "And this keeps evolving. As I test new approaches and find tools worth using, I'll bring those into the community through exclusive drops and new training."}, {"s": 73.655, "e": 82.2, "text": "If you follow my content and want to go deeper into how I actually approach building an online business, this is where that happens."}, {"s": 82.5, "e": 87.562, "text": "Join us inside, share what you're working on, and start applying it alongside us."}]}